  "source": "mbmd meters/rs485/orno1p.go (github.com/volkszaehler/mbmd); Register description OR-WE-514&OR-WE-515: https://github.com/gituser-rk/orno-modbus-mqtt/blob/master/Register%20description%20OR-WE-514%26OR-WE-515.pdf; ustawienia portu: https://files.orno.pl/manuals/OR-WE-512,514,515_manual_EN.pdf",
